This directory vendors the tree-sitter-jinja2 grammar from
https://github.com/geigerzaehler/tree-sitter-jinja2
at commit 7af726f7ac42db3fe798d45ee375078bbef28a41.

The upstream repository declares `license = "MIT"` in its Cargo.toml
(author: geigerzaehler). The grammar sources here (grammar.js, src/parser.c,
src/node-types.json, queries/) are used under that MIT declaration; the MIT
license text is reproduced below. The Rust bindings in bindings/rust/ were
rewritten for this fork and are offered under the same MIT terms.

